// Addon descriptions live in constants.js as a single Hebrew `desc` per item
// (which stays as the ultimate fallback). This file holds per-language
// descriptions keyed by addon id, so the UI can render the right language.
//
// Structure:
//   addonDescriptions = { he: { <id>: '...' }, en: { <id>: '...' }, ... }
//
// `he` mirrors the constants.js descs verbatim; `en` is a natural English
// translation. New languages can be added as additional keys over time —
// addonDesc() falls back en -> the raw constants.js desc so nothing renders
// blank while a language is still partial.

